id: lightspeed-mode-super-maximum-lightspeed-mode
name: Super Maximum Lightspeed Mode
order: 5
slot: transcendent
# Its [Permanent] effects: they hold outside the Transformation too.
permanent: 1
description: >
  Your extreme speed increases beyond the scale of imagination as you accelerate to a velocity that dwarfs the speed of light by comparison.
text: >
  Super Maximum Lightspeed Mode: Your extreme speed increases beyond the scale of imagination as you accelerate to a velocity that dwarfs the speed of light by comparison.
  (1)-[Permanent]: Gain access to the 3rd and 4th Grades of Lightspeed Mode.
  (2)-[Passive]: Halve the reduction to your Dodge Rolls from the Guard Down Combat Condition.
  (3)-[Passive]: While in the 3rd or 4th grades of Lightspeed Mode, halve the penalty from your Diminishing Defense.
  (4)-[Triggered, 1/Encounter]: If you apply the 4th effect of Speed Star to an Attacking Maneuver, you may apply a number of Energy Charges to that Attacking Maneuver equal to 1/2 (rounded up) of G.

---

# (1) Its 3rd and 4th Grades: said on its Grade box. (2) Guard Down's Dodge halved, (3) Diminishing Defense halved and (4) Energy
# Charges with Speed Star (4): the table's.
